Crokinole
=========

A traditional game, free for everyone to play (played on wooden boards since the 1800s). The rules in the game are
restated in our own words.

Game, code, art and sound: Luis Montes. The board, the discs, the table textures and every sound are made in code at
load (games/crokinole/src/art.c, src/sound.c); there are no image or audio files.

The mesh builder (src/geo.c) comes from the same author's pinball in even-more-cartwheel-examples (MIT).

Built on cartwheel-engine and three.c (MIT licence, Copyright 2026 Luis Montes), which carry three.js's MIT licence
(Copyright 2010-2026 three.js authors) for the generated programs.
